  To take the transpose of a batch of sparse matrices, where 0 is the batch
  dimension, you would set `perm=[0,2,1]`.

  >>> x_transpose = tf.sparse.transpose(x, perm=[0, 2, 1])
  >>> print('x_transpose =', tf.sparse.to_dense(x_transpose))
